<title>PERU: Peru's D'Onofrio 1996 net up slightly.</title>
<headline>Peru's D'Onofrio 1996 net up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 5.574 million soles vs 5.555 million soles.</p>
<p>Revs - 182.229 million soles vs 193.044 million soles.</p>
<p>NOTES: D'Onofrio is a Peruvian ice-cream and confectionery company and blue-chip on the Lima Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>((-- Andrew Cawthorne, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
